        "identifier": "https://github.com/sthubbar/goldbach-lean/tree/main/entries/languascozaccagnini2012",
        "note": "The Languasco-Zaccagnini 2012 entry of this repository proves under RH an asymptotic for the same sum with error O(N log^3 N). Its proof contains, as gs_theorem1_proved, the in particular form equation 13 of Goldston and Suriajaya, with the three lower terms in O(N), but not the exact identity equation 11, which is new here. Its lz_zeroSum_summable is the summability proved here as zeroSum_summable.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/sthubbar/goldbach-lean/tree/main/entries/goldstonyang2016",
        "note": "The Goldston-Yang 2016 entry of this repository proves under RH the Cesàro weighted formula with error O(N), from the same lab library.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "PALOMAR-2026-10-21-000011",
        "note": "The Granville 2007 entry of this repository proves that RH is equivalent to the sum of G(n) over n <= N being N^2/2 + O(N^{3/2+eps}). It uses the same definition of G and no zero sum.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd",
        "note": "A search on 2026-10-22 of Mathlib, of PrimeNumberTheoremAnd at commit 127b50e33f6033e2147921167a117af96d9ba4ea, of google-deepmind/formal-conjectures and of the web found no earlier Lean formalization of Theorem 1 of Goldston and Suriajaya or of an explicit formula for the sum of psi_2. PrimeNumberTheoremAnd has a Weil type explicit formula in IEANTN/Kadiri.lean, for a different purpose, and a numerical Goldbach file.",
